'''Crazed Princess Punt''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] increases health, attack range, attack rate, and chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] Enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

